<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<div class="container py-5">
    <p class="text-muted">Effective Date: June 12, 2025</p>

    <p>At <strong>KarnelTravels</strong>, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit our website.</p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h4>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, contact details (submitted via forms).</li>
        <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> IP address, browser info, pages visited, and time on site.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 class="mt-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>To respond to your inquiries and support requests</li>
        <li>To improve our website and services</li>
        <li>To send newsletters and promotional emails (with your consent)</li>
        <li>To manage travel bookings and services</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 class="mt-4">3. Sharing Your Information</h4>
    <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell or trade your personal data. We may only share it with trusted third-party partners who help us operate our website or services, and only as needed.</p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">4. Cookies</h4>
    <p>We use cookies to improve your browsing experience. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, but some features may not work properly.</p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">5. Security</h4>
    <p>We use reasonable measures to protect your data. However, no internet transmission is 100% secure.</p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">6. Your Rights</h4>
    <p>You may opt-out of emails, and you can request to access or delete your data by contacting us.</p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">7. Updates to This Policy</h4>
    <p>We may update this policy as needed. Changes will be posted on this page with the updated date.</p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">8. Contact Us</h4>
    <address>
        KarnelTravels<br>
        4567 Palmview Avenue, Los Angeles, CA 90028<br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:support@karneltravels.com">support@karneltravels.com</a><br>
        Phone: +1 (555) 123-4567
    </address>
</div>
